schema: "0.4"
id: echo-of-manifestation-ui-inventory-screen
type: html
service: anthropic
quality: medium

prompt:
  system: "Generate a complete, self-contained HTML file with inline CSS. Modern, polished visual design. Dark fantasy aesthetic with amber accents on deep indigo-black backgrounds."
  text: >
    Create a dark fantasy game inventory screen for "Echo of Manifestation" — a survival
    horror roguelite. Full-viewport layout, no scrolling needed.

    LEFT PANEL (60% width): "Inventory" tab active — a grid inventory system.
    - Tab bar at top with three tabs: "Inventory" (active, amber highlight), "Chimera Codex",
      "Insight Lab"
    - Below tabs: a grid of inventory slots (6 columns x 5 rows = 30 slots). Each slot is
      a square with a dark metal border (#2a1a2a) and slightly lighter interior (#1a0a1e).
      - 8-10 slots should contain item icons: a sword silhouette, a bow shape, a flask,
        a crystal, a lantern, a bomb shape, a shield shape, a scroll shape. These should
        be simple CSS-drawn icons or ASCII symbols in amber (#D4A574).
      - Remaining slots are empty but still visible as grid cells.
      - One slot should have a highlighted border (selected item).
    - Below the grid: "Essence: x12" counter with a small crystal icon, left-aligned.

    RIGHT PANEL (40% width): Item details panel.
    - Header area showing the selected item name: "Iron Sword" in large amber text.
    - Item type: "Melee Weapon" in smaller muted text.
    - A larger view of the item icon — a more detailed representation of the sword.
    - Stats section:
      - Damage: 15
      - Chimera Risk: 20%
      - Resonance Cost: Low
    - Description: "A worn longsword that has seen better days. The blade shows signs of
      alchemical exposure. Transmuting this item spawns a Shadow Blade chimera." — in
      smaller body text, off-white (#c8bca8).
    - Below description: Two action buttons — "Equip" and "Transmute". Buttons have dark
      metal styling with amber borders. "Transmute" button should have a subtle warning
      quality — perhaps a faint red-amber tint or a small warning icon, suggesting the
      risk of chimera spawning.

    FOOTER: A thin horizontal bar spanning both panels with hint text:
    "[1-5] Select Slot | [E] Equip | [T] Transmute | [ESC] Close"

    Style: Deep indigo-black (#0a0514) backgrounds. Amber (#D4A574) accents and active
    states. Dark metal (#2a1a2a) borders. Off-white (#c8bca8) body text. No rounded
    corners — angular, crafted, alchemical instrument aesthetic. Consistent with the
    HUD and main menu designs.
  provider_options:
    text_format: html
    max_tokens: 4096

output:
  formats:
    - format: html

tags: [ui, mockup, inventory, game-interface, dark-fantasy]
